<title>USA: San Antonio feeder cattle prices mixed - USDA.</title>
<headline>San Antonio feeder cattle prices mixed - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $2.00 per cwt higher, compared to Monday, USDA said. Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included around 15 percent slaughter cows and bulls; 35 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs with balance mostly feeder cattle under 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 70.00-78.00; 700-800 lbs 66.50-75.00; 800-900 lbs 67.50-69.50. Medium and Large 1-2 - few 600-900 lbs 60.25-68.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 66.50-72.50, few replacement quality 97.00-106.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - 500-600 lbs 63.00-67.75; few 600-800 lbs 60.25-65.50.</p>
<p>Receipts - 377    Last Week - 907    Last Year - 617</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
